     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nDear Jim,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nthanks for the interest. Would love to, but I guess for this year we&#39;re workshopped-out.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nBest regards  -- Marc</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Jim Casaer &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jim.c...@inbo.be</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, January 25, 2023 20:46<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hmec...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hmec...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;; Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Royle, Andy &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">aro...@usgs.gov</a>&gt;; Kellner, Kenneth &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kell...@msu.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: [unmarked] AHM workshop @Patuxent, 17-21 July 2023</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Marc,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Do you also intend to organize the same training in Europe (Switserland) later this year?</div>\r\n<div>I&#39;m convinced there are plenty of people in Europe also interested in following a similar training.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>many greetings from Belgium</div>\r\n<div>Jim Casaer</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br clear=\"all\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Dr.ir. Jim Casaer</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Senior Researcher</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Research Group wildlife Management / OT </span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"> Faunabeheer en Exoten/ </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Research Institute for Nature and Forest / Instituut voor Natuur- en Bosonderzoek</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/fKckz4717yUjDBExSOHF44qnoOIjhs0aBAE0TS0lad14TAX5Epvdg3PLtpGFmKvY2133u5mL27NK=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.inbo.be/docupload/4479.jpg\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Havenlaan 88 bus 73,</div>\r\n<div>1000 Brussel</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jim.c...@inbo.be</a></div>\r\n<div>** 32 478 281 701 </div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://www.inbo.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inbo.be&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449081205000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yusj6tiP4pZQU9CH08E62\">www.inbo.be</a></div>\r\n<div>orcid : <span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap\">0000-0001-6788-5876</span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Op wo 25 jan. 2023 om 20:14 schreef Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Dear all,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Ken Kellner, Andy Royle and I will run an AHM workshop at what used to be the glorious Patuxent Wildlife Research Center in Laurel, MD, during 17-21 July 2023. We will show how to use likelihood\r\n and Bayesian methods to fit a large range of models that are useful for investigations of abundance and occupancy. Planned topics include:</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Occupancy models for binary detection/nondetection data</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span><u></u></span></li><li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Binomial N-mixture models for replicated count data</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span><u></u></span></li><li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Multinomial N-mixture models for replicated capture-recapture data</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span><u></u></span></li><li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Distance sampling models for a variety of distance sampling protocols</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span><u></u></span></li><li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Modeling of false positives</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span><u></u></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"></span></li><li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Integrating multiple data types and integrated models</span></li></ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;text-indent:35.4pt\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\">Please send your application to Andy Royle (</span><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">aro...@usgs.gov</a></span></span></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\">),\r\n with CC to </span><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a></span></span></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\">\r\n and </span><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kell...@msu.edu</a></span></span></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\">,\r\n and describe your background and knowledge in statistical modelling, R and JAGS/Nimble, and occupancy/Nmix models,\r\n<b>by </b></span><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">30 April 2023</span></span></b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" lang=\"EN-AU\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><u></u><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\"> </span><u></u></span></p>\r\n</span></span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</span></span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">You find some more information\r\n in the attached flier.</span></span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</span></span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-AU\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Best regards --- Marc, Ken\r\n and Andy<br>\r\n</span></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n-- <br>\r\n*** Three hierarchical modeling email lists ***<br>\r\n(1) unmarked (this list): for questions specific to the R package unmarked<br>\r\n(2) SCR: for design and Bayesian or non-bayesian analysis of spatial capture-recapture<br>\r\n(3) HMecology: for everything else, especially material covered in the books by Royle &amp; Dorazio (2008), Kéry &amp; Schaub (2012), Kéry &amp; Royle (2016, 2021) and Schaub &amp; Kéry (2022)<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nunmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/ZR0P278MB086933D14F651DFAECEE03D6EBCE9%40ZR0P278MB0869.CHEP278.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/ZR0P278MB086933D14F651DFAECEE03D6EBCE9%2540ZR0P278MB0869.CHEP278.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449081205000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U3-_rimA9BjQuumlQcX5m\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/ZR0P278MB086933D14F651DFAECEE03D6EBCE9%40ZR0P278MB0869.CHEP278.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM</a>.<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>"
